{"id":"eb28ae6b68c324b2","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kt-omega-characterization.md","title":"以相对停机概率刻画K平凡性","display":"thm-kt-omega-characterization — 以相对停机概率刻画K平凡性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kt-omega-characterization","aliases":["43-thm-kt-omega-characterization"],"display":"thm-kt-omega-characterization — 以相对停机概率刻画K平凡性","depends_on":["[[43-df-ktrivial]]","[[43-df-omega-operator]]","[[43-df-oracle-prefix-machine]]","[[43-df-delta02]]","[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 15.8.2; printed pp.474–475 / PDF pp.494–495","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kt-omega-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kt-omega-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kt-omega-characterization — 以相对停机概率刻画K平凡性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"19dbd8d7e38e55f5\" href=\"?note=19dbd8d7e38e55f5\" title=\"43-df-oracle-prefix-machine\">43-df-oracle-prefix-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"801b1a72671fc17a\" href=\"?note=801b1a72671fc17a\" title=\"43-df-delta02\">43-df-delta02</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 15.8.2; printed pp.474–475 / PDF pp.494–495"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(U\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"19dbd8d7e38e55f5\" href=\"?note=19dbd8d7e38e55f5\" title=\"43-df-oracle-prefix-machine\">43-df-oracle-prefix-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U^A\">\\(\\Omega_U^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a>，并假设</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U^A=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega_U^A=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivial}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^0_2\">\\(\\Delta^0_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>、Turing归约和跳跃分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"801b1a72671fc17a\" href=\"?note=801b1a72671fc17a\" title=\"43-df-delta02\">43-df-delta02</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff\\left(\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)\\in\\Delta^0_2\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\Omega_U^A)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff\\left(\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)\\in\\Delta^0_2\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\Omega_U^A)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff A\\le_TX.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff A\\le_TX.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff A&#39;\\equiv_TX.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff A&#39;\\equiv_TX.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留第二项的Delta02假设及同一台统一通用oracle机器U；没有把“某个相对Omega左c.e.”单独等同于K平凡性。显式序列X使实数运算与Turing归约各自具有正确输入类型。四项等价另核对 Downey–Hirschfeldt–Miller–Nies, Relativizing Chaitin’s Halting Probability, Theorem 8.3，<a href=\"https://www.math.uchicago.edu/~drh/Papers/Papers/omega.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.math.uchicago.edu/~drh/Papers/Papers/omega.pdf</a> 。附件原书定位为Theorem 15.8.2，印刷474–475页/PDF494–495页；此次未重新核对该原书PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"19dbd8d7e38e55f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-delta02","st